Capabilities design: MergeProtocolCapabilities preserves an explicit
false rather than only filling nil. A host that turned activity deltas
off has suppressed those events; advertising them anyway would tell
clients to expect a stream they will not get.

Docs record the things a host cannot infer from the type signatures:
that activity reaches the stream only via a part converter, that an
unchanged repeat emits nothing because the SDK rejects empty patches,
why the encrypted blob rides the assistant message rather than the
reasoning message, and that only 'ag-ui' is protocol namespace.
